1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,382
Generate your résumé with AI, formatted for where you apply.

2
00:00:05,682 --> 00:00:11,551
Before a human reads your résumé, software does. Pretty templates fail it.

3
00:00:11,551 --> 00:00:16,151
So every format here is rated. Five stars reads perfectly.

4
00:00:16,451 --> 00:00:18,147
Open Resume Builder.

5
00:00:18,447 --> 00:00:23,649
Paste anything. An old résumé, a LinkedIn bio, rough notes.

6
00:00:23,949 --> 00:00:27,287
Generate. A structured résumé comes back.

7
00:00:27,587 --> 00:00:32,662
A German CV needs a photo. A US résumé must not have one.

8
00:00:32,662 --> 00:00:36,580
Pick your region, and it rebuilds instantly.

9
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:40,501
Swipe the formats. Each one shows its star rating.

10
00:00:40,801 --> 00:00:43,754
Download as PDF or Word.

11
00:00:44,054 --> 00:00:47,349
Next. Save a job, and skip the research.

